{"id":"600522","name":"黑椒牛排意面","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/600522/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"菲力牛排","amount":"一块"},{"name":"意面","amount":"一包"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"西红柿","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜瓣","amount":"几颗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛排从冰箱拿出后放软。","img":"images/600522/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"准备西红柿、鸡蛋、蒜瓣。","img":"images/600522/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"意面煮十分钟后捞起。","img":"images/600522/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"牛排用厨房纸吸去表面的水分。","img":"images/600522/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中放油，牛排入锅煎。","img":"images/600522/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煎至八成熟。","img":"images/600522/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取出切成小块，备用。","img":"images/600522/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"用四孔煎锅，把鸡蛋、西红柿、蒜同时入锅煎熟。","img":"images/600522/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"黑椒汁加少许水化开煮沸，浇入牛排表面即可。","img":"images/600522/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。牛排意面套餐完成。","img":"images/600522/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}